CHAPTER.VERS:
How do you

          {+}
         say, We are wise, and the law of Yahweh is with us? But, look, the false pen of the scribes has wrought falsely.

For, look, I will send serpents, adders, among you

          {+}
        , which will not be charmed; and they will bite you

          {+}
        , says Yahweh.
